{
  "source": "Prompts/document-trap-v8.mp4",
  "duration": 173.6106875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.78,
      "text": "Your big season-end basketball tournament starts next week, so you definitely want to brush up on the rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.74,
      "end": 12.12,
      "text": "You upload your league's massive 200-page rulebook to an AI chatbot and ask a simple question."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.78,
      "end": 14.92,
      "text": "How many fouls until I'm out of the game?"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.0,
      "end": 20.44,
      "text": "Chat GPT answers instantly, with total confidence. Five fouls and you foul out."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.2,
      "end": 21.74,
      "text": "Wait a second."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.54,
      "end": 27.92,
      "text": "In last year's tournament, you specifically remember a player picking up five fouls and staying on the court."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.64,
      "end": 30.84,
      "text": "You dig through the physical rulebook yourself to check."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.54,
      "end": 35.62,
      "text": "The regular season section says exactly what the AI did, five fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.1,
      "end": 40.38,
      "text": "But buried near the back, there's a special section strictly for tournaments."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.04,
      "end": 42.58,
      "text": "In those games, players get six."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.34,
      "end": 50.28,
      "text": "The AI pulled the standard limit and missed the exception, delivering a factual but dangerously incomplete answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.94,
      "end": 56.8,
      "text": "This is the document trap, the assumption that an uploaded document is a fully understood document."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.5,
      "end": 61.42,
      "text": "Uploading a file doesn't mean the AI instantly memorizes every single word."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.04,
      "end": 67.04,
      "text": "A short file might fit entirely inside the AI's active memory, known as its context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.58,
      "end": 74.84,
      "text": "But when you ask a question about a long file, the system might search the document and pull only the matching passages into that window."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.62,
      "end": 77.76,
      "text": "That highlights the flaw in the initial prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.34,
      "end": 83.48,
      "text": "You were thinking about a tournament, but failed to actually include the word tournament in your question."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.48,
      "end": 89.36,
      "text": "Because of that omission, the retrieval machine only pulled pages matching standard fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.62,
      "end": 92.58,
      "text": "It left the AI completely blind to the tournament exception."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.32,
      "end": 94.46,
      "text": "Try asking it this way."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 97.46,
      "text": "In tournament games, how many fouls are allowed?"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.92,
      "end": 99.62,
      "text": "Quote, the rule and any exceptions."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.92,
      "end": 108.42,
      "text": "Given that precise target, the AI's corrected answer now successfully acknowledges the explicit six-foul allowance for league tournaments."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.34,
      "end": 112.96,
      "text": "This infographic outlines four tips for working with long documents."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.96,
      "end": 117.86,
      "text": "A systematic approach to make the right passages easier for the retrieval machine to find."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.8,
      "end": 120.38,
      "text": "Step one, name the section."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.06,
      "end": 126.1,
      "text": "Using the document's exact headings and keywords creates a stronger magnet for the AI's search function."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.98,
      "end": 128.5,
      "text": "Step two, ask one thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.2,
      "end": 131.76,
      "text": "Step three, share what matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.08,
      "end": 133.96,
      "text": "By pasting only the relevant section."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.94,
      "end": 137.14,
      "text": "Finally, step four, ask for the quote."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.14,
      "end": 145.12,
      "text": "By asking the AI to quote the exact passage, you can immediately compare its answer with the original text to verify the claim."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.02,
      "end": 151.16,
      "text": "These four moves will organize your evidence, but they do not guarantee a complete answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.94,
      "end": 155.04,
      "text": "The document trap extends far beyond the basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.7,
      "end": 161.2,
      "text": "Here in the real world, dense paperwork like apartment leases, complex employment contracts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.2,
      "end": 167.26,
      "text": "and financial aid letters can hide conditions or exceptions that can completely change your bottom line."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.3,
      "end": 170.18,
      "text": "Uploaded doesn't mean fully read."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.86,
      "end": 172.78,
      "text": "Ask for the rule and any exceptions."
    }
  ],
